<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrift</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behülfflich</unclear> undt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befürderlichen</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erscheinen</unclear>
