<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wohnausredt</unclear> undt der sachen beschaffenheit undt billigkeit
<lb n="22"/>wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruchtbahr</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genießen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> wir dan
