<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aüff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begebenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> Eüch und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüwerigen</unclear> mit gleich-
